// Namespaced `MacDringCInotify`, not `CInotify`: PictKit ships an identically-purposed
// CInotify shim, and once the daemon links both packages (PictKit lands in a later LP)
// two Clang modules named `CInotify` in one graph would fail to build. The distinct
// name keeps them co-linkable. (The systemLibrary target name must match this.)
module MacDringCInotify [system] {
    header "shim.h"
    export *
}
